    "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-metacat/sphn/hasDataUseRestriction": [
      {
        "@value": "Consent to use the anonymized data needs to be given by the president of the MIBB working group. The data can be requested via Mail at info@adjumed.ch with a short description of the intended research use. Adjumed will handle the request and contact the PI who currently governs access. No redistribution or sharing to secondary users."
